	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『ヤマトよ永遠に REBEL3199』から第3次改装型：参戦章叙勲式典記念塗装のヤマトが1/1000スケールでいよいよ登場！",
			"• 船首の錨マークは凸モールドで再現。細部までこだわった精密なディテールと水転写式デカールで参戦章叙勲式典記念塗装を表現できる。",
			"• 特徴的な甲板色はパーツ分けと一部デカールにより表現。",
			"• 艦載機であるコスモタイガーII(単座)、コスモタイガーII(三座)が付属。",
			"• ディスプレイ用の台座が付属。",
			"• パーツとデカールの選択で2205版の再現が可能。"
		],
		"en": [
			"The 3rd renovated version from \"Yamato Forever REBEL3199\": Yamato commemorating the battle medal award ceremony is finally available in 1/1000 Scale!",
			"• The anchor mark on the bow is reproduced with a convex mold. Precise details and water transfer decals allow you to express the commemorative painting of the combat medal ceremony.",
			"• The distinctive deck color is expressed by dividing the parts and some decals.",
			"• Carrier-based aircraft Cosmo Tiger II (single seat) and Cosmo Tiger II (three seat) are included.",
			"• Includes display pedestal.",
			"• It is possible to reproduce the 2205 version by selecting parts and decals."
		]
	},
